        "tex": "S_y=(2x-y)_\\#R_y=Z_y^{-1}e^{-W_y}du,\\quad W_y(u)=V((y+u)/2)+\\|u-y\\|^2/(8\\eta);\\quad\\Delta u=\\varepsilon u+\\langle\\nabla W_y,\\overline D_yu\\rangle-f\\quad\\text{in distributions}."
