      "statement": "For actual source V/alpha/beta/eta, construct genuine common augmentation R/S and exact reflected conditional laws. For every y, retain the true positive integrable C2 W_y and original dense closable compact smooth gradient D_y before epsilon/input. Every epsilon>0 and actual f in L2(S_y) has u in that same closure domain, the full variational and ordinary weak-gradient identities, genuine local volume L2 of u/G/k_y, locally integrable squared norm of k_y, and for all C2 compact phi the legal ordinary volume distribution identity integral u Delta phi = integral k_y phi, where k_y=epsilon u+inner(gradient W_y,G)-f. Reflected/RGO laws and scales remain distinct.",
      "formula": "S_y=(2x-y)_\\#R_y=Z_y^{-1}e^{-W_y}du,\\quad W_y(u)=V((y+u)/2)+\\|u-y\\|^2/(8\\eta);\\quad\\Delta u=\\varepsilon u+\\langle\\nabla W_y,\\overline D_yu\\rangle-f\\quad\\text{in distributions}.",
