          "text": "For each y retain the original dense closable exact compact smooth gradient D_y and its closed closure. Neither the operator nor kernels depend on epsilon or the forcing. Reduction of C2 W_y to C1 changes only the regularity interface.",
          "formula": "\\exists R,S\\ \\forall y\\ \\exists D_y\\ \\forall\\varepsilon>0\\ \\forall f\\in L^2(S_y).",
