          "text": "A focused test uses the actual nonquadratic V(x)=3x^2/8+sin(x)/8, true curvature between 1/2 and 1, eta in (0,1], and phi(x)=rho(x)(x^2)^(5/2) with genuine normalized smooth compact bump rho. It extracts both integrability conclusions and the particular ordinary PDE from the true conditional solution, for every positive epsilon and actual forcing.",
          "formula": "V(x)=\\tfrac38x^2+\\tfrac18\\sin x,\\quad\\phi(x)=\\rho(x)(x^2)^{5/2}\\in C_c^2,\\quad\\int u\\Delta\\phi=\\int k_y\\phi.",
